Submission code in this archive is provided so reviewers can read and run the reported experiments.

Third-party benchmarks under benchmarks/ keep the license files shipped in those checkouts.
The Qwen3-8B base model is Apache-2.0. See NOTICE.
The exported adapters are QLoRA weights for that base model and stay under the base model's license.
Training JSON included here is experiment material for review. It is not a new public dataset release.
